From 40cda8f3e9c1a08a578dc7723e75e92ab79947d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:20:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: bot combat kit + safer travel - per-target Rend, AoE
 gate, potions, food, ranged pull, camp detours, stop-and-fight (F-219)

- combat.kill: peak_attackers + pull result per fight; abilities gain per_target (Rend on
  every attacker), min_attackers (Thunder Clap only on packs), item_id (potions); pull_spell
  opens from range and waits for the target to walk out of its camp
- combat.rest eats food first when low; interact gains set_ammo + equipped slots in inventory
- move.path_to stop_on_attack (move now hears SMSG_ATTACKSTART/ATTACKERSTATEUPDATE); zepnav
  queries time out after 15 s and restart the helper instead of hanging the module
- runner: travel skirts hostile camps (aggro radius by level, each camp once per trip) and
  stops to fight anything that engages; supplies() buys ranged weapon/ammo/food the class can
  use from area vendors; every fight logged pull/defend xN; paladin Holy Light below 40 %
- rpc: a stalled call fails the step instead of crashing the runner

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
